<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</title>
<headline>Argentine weekly grain/oilseed export snapshot.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Secretariat weekly estimate, to June 18, of 1996/97 shipments, export commitments and purchases by exporters in indicated crop years:</p>
<p> ...........shipments..commits..crop year...exporter purchases</p>
<p>(thousands of tonnes).........................1997/98..1996/97</p>
<p> Bread wheat  8,095.4  9,300.0   Dec-Nov	   98.1  9,334.1</p>
<p> Forrage wheat  188.3    230.0   Dec-Nov	    n/a    188.6</p>
<p> Maize	  6,740.0  6,800.0   Mar-Feb	    2.6  7,621.1</p>
<p> Sorghum	  447.5    450.0   Mar-Feb	    n/a    541.0</p>
<p> Soybeans	 443.9    500.0   Apr-Mar	    2.7  1,336.1</p>
<p> Sunseeds	   8.6     15.0   Jan-Dec	    n/a    148.0</p>
